WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.666
(intense music)

00:00:02.666 --> 00:00:05.246
- I've gotten several nicknames.

00:00:05.246 --> 00:00:07.098
One of the biggest ones that stick out

00:00:07.098 --> 00:00:10.080
in my mind was One Run Anderson.

00:00:10.080 --> 00:00:12.747
I would run one time, and
I'm gonna tell you right now,

00:00:12.747 --> 00:00:15.012
you'd better have your cameras ready,

00:00:15.012 --> 00:00:18.270
because it was gonna be one, big bad run.

00:00:18.270 --> 00:00:21.932
I'm Dennis Anderson, and I'm
the Original Grave Digger.

00:00:21.932 --> 00:00:24.196
(engine rumbles)
(light guitar music)

00:00:24.196 --> 00:00:26.263
If you don't know what a monster truck is,

00:00:26.263 --> 00:00:28.398
it's because you're a
concrete-cruisin' city slicker.

00:00:28.398 --> 00:00:30.731
The definition of a monster truck is

00:00:30.731 --> 00:00:33.564
it has to have a 66-43 Terra tire,

00:00:35.067 --> 00:00:38.816
meaning 66 inches tall, 43 inches wide,

00:00:38.816 --> 00:00:41.891
and normally they are
around 10 to 12 foot tall

00:00:41.891 --> 00:00:44.227
and 12 foot wide, and they usually weigh

00:00:44.227 --> 00:00:46.456
about 10 to 12 thousand pounds.

00:00:46.456 --> 00:00:48.693
That's what a monster truck is.

00:00:48.693 --> 00:00:50.663
My goal in life as a kid growing up

00:00:50.663 --> 00:00:52.241
is I wanted to be this big farmer.

00:00:52.241 --> 00:00:53.924
It never really was a goal in life

00:00:53.924 --> 00:00:57.287
for me to be a pro
Monster Jam truck driver.

00:00:57.287 --> 00:01:01.454
- [Announcer] Dennis Anderson,
and the Grave Digger!

00:01:04.033 --> 00:01:06.632
- The whole legacy of Grave Digger,

00:01:06.632 --> 00:01:09.253
this right here was the
first stepping stone.

00:01:09.253 --> 00:01:11.523
My goal in life as I
was building this truck

00:01:11.523 --> 00:01:14.937
was to have a big, nice
shop with a concrete floor,

00:01:14.937 --> 00:01:17.579
because I built this thing
in a tin chicken house.

00:01:17.579 --> 00:01:20.775
I call it my empire, and
it's the Grave Digger

00:01:20.775 --> 00:01:24.039
empire here, now up to nine Grave Diggers.

00:01:24.039 --> 00:01:28.206
We've built 32 Grave Digger
trucks in the last 34 years.

00:01:29.128 --> 00:01:30.735
This is the dino room,

00:01:30.735 --> 00:01:33.458
my most favorite place on the property.

00:01:33.458 --> 00:01:37.563
1500 horsepower, and we're
gonna see a test pull right now.

00:01:37.563 --> 00:01:40.313
(engine rumbles)

00:01:41.836 --> 00:01:42.669
Yeah, baby!

00:01:43.506 --> 00:01:47.347
(light ambient music)

00:01:47.347 --> 00:01:50.753
Trust me, I have paid my dues
all the way down the line.

00:01:50.753 --> 00:01:53.801
I have fractured my back,
I've broke my shoulder,

00:01:53.801 --> 00:01:55.943
I've broke my ribs, I've broke my nose

00:01:55.943 --> 00:01:58.990
a couple of times, I've broke my arms.

00:01:58.990 --> 00:02:01.583
When you talk about living a dream,

00:02:01.583 --> 00:02:03.758
that's this old guy right here.

00:02:03.758 --> 00:02:06.889
I never have grown up, I still love toys,

00:02:06.889 --> 00:02:11.024
and that's why Grave
Digger is what it is today.

00:02:11.024 --> 00:02:14.274
(light ambient music)

